The Aquemi mark (four dots, two joined by a wave) and the lockup of mark plus wordmark. All files are single-ink, so pick the file by its background.

| File | Ink | Use on |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `aquemi-mark-navy.svg` | `navy` #0F2A47 | `surface`, `surface-raised`, `limestone`, white paper |
| `aquemi-mark-limestone.svg` | `limestone` #EBDFD6 | `navy` bands, the footer, dark mode |
| `aquemi-lockup-navy.svg` | `navy` #0F2A47 | Light grounds |
| `aquemi-lockup-limestone.svg` | `limestone` #EBDFD6 | `navy` grounds |
| `aquemi-lockup-navy.png` | `navy` #0F2A47, transparent, 3000 px wide | Office documents and tools that can't use SVG |

The mark's SVGs sit in a 512 × 512 box with the mark centred at 340 units across. Clear space is half the mark's width. Minimum size is 16 px on screen; the lockup's minimum width is 140 px.
